t capable"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உய்த்தனர்","parts":[{"text":"உய்த்தனர்","lemma":"uy","gloss":"they led"}],"gloss":"they led"},{"surface":"விடாஅர்","parts":[{"text":"விடாஅர்","lemma":"விடாஅர்","gloss":"they do not let go"}],"gloss":"they do not let go","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிரித்து","parts":[{"text":"பிரித்து","lemma":"piri","gloss":"having separated"}],"gloss":"having separated"},{"surface":"இடை","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"iṭai","gloss":"in between"}],"gloss":"in between"},{"surface":"களையார்","parts":[{"text":"களையார்","lemma":"kaḷai","gloss":"they do not remove"}],"gloss":"they do not remove"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குப்பை","parts":[{"text":"குப்பை","lemma":"kuppai","gloss":"rubbish heap"}],"gloss":"rubbish heap"},{"surface":"கோழி","parts":[{"text":"கோழி","lemma":"kōḻi","gloss":"rooster"}],"gloss":"rooster"},{"surface":"தனி","parts":[{"text":"தனி","lemma":"taṉi","gloss":"solitary"}],"gloss":"solitary"},{"surface":"போர்","parts":[{"text":"போர்","lemma":"pōr","gloss":"fight"}],"gloss":"fight"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விளிவு","parts":[{"text":"விளிவு","lemma":"viḷivu","gloss":"death"}],"gloss":"death"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"āṅku","gloss":"like that"}],"gloss":"like that"},{"surface":"விளியின்","parts":[{"text":"விளியின்","lemma":"viḷi","gloss":"if dying"}],"gloss":"if dying"},{"surface":"அல்லது","parts":[{"text":"அல்லது","lemma":"allatu","gloss":"other than"}],"gloss":"other than"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களைவோர்","parts":[{"text":"களைவோர்","lemma":"kaḷai","gloss":"those who remove"}],"gloss":"those who remove"},{"surface":"இலை","parts":[{"text":"இலை","lemma":"ilai","gloss":"are not there"}],"gloss":"are not there"},{"surface":"ஆ","parts":[{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"முற்ற","parts":[{"text":"முற்ற","lemma":"muṟṟu","gloss":"intense"}],"gloss":"intense"},{"surface":"நோயே","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"nōy","gloss":"pain"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the affliction"}]}],"literal":"The bright fire of desire that came as our eyes met, / even if it afflicts me to the very bones, cherishing him, / we are of rare sight to go and embrace him; / he is not capable of coming and removing this grief; / they do not let go after leading us, nor do they separate us in between to remove the pain; / like the solitary fight of roosters on a rubbish heap, / other than dying as death comes, / there are indeed none to remove this intense affliction.","translation":"The bright fire of desire, sparked when our eyes met, afflicts me to the very bone. Yet, though I long for him, I cannot go and embrace him, for he is hard to see. Nor is he capable of coming to relieve my grief. They do not let us go, nor do they step in to separate us and end this pain. Like the solitary duel of roosters on a rubbish heap, which ends only when one dies, there is no one to stop this intense affliction, except death itself.","modern":"கண்கள் சந்தித்ததால் உண்டான காமமாகிய பிரகாசமான நெருப்பு, என் எலும்புகளைத் துளைத்து வருத்தினாலும், அவரோடு கூடி வாழ விரும்பி, நாம் அவரிடம் சென்று தழுவுவதற்கு அவர் நமக்குக் காண்பதற்கு அரியவராக இருக்கிறார். அவரும் இங்கு வந்து என் துன்பத்தைப் போக்க வல்லமை இல்லாதவராக இருக்கிறார். நம்மைச் சேர்ந்தவர்கள் நம்மைச் சேர்த்து வைக்கவும் மாட்டார்கள், அல்லது நம்மைப் பிரித்துத் துன்பத்தைத் தீர்க்கவும் மாட்டார்கள். குப்பை மேட்டில் சண்டையிடும் இரு கோழிகளின் தனிமையான போரைப் போல, மரணம் அடைந்தால் ஒழிய, இந்த முற்றிய நோயைத் தீர்ப்பவர் யாரும் இல்லை.","explanation":"The heroine is expressing her deep anguish to her close friend during her separation from the hero. She describes her desire as a bright fire that was sparked when their eyes first met, which now tortures her to the very bone. She is helpless because she cannot go to him, and he is unable to come and relieve her grief. Furthermore, the people around them neither help them unite nor separate them to end the agony. She compares her situation to a solitary fight between two roosters on a rubbish heap, a duel that has no spectators or mediators to stop it, and which can only end with the death of one of the fighters. The key words are 'காம ஒள்ளெரி' (bright fire of desire) and 'குப்பைக்கோழித் தனிப்போர்' (solitary fight of dunghill roosters).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.65],[1.65,2.11],[2.11,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.42],[3.42,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.76,5.28],[5.28,5.54],[5.6,6.44],[6.44,6.8],[6.8,7.94],[7.94,8.29],[8.29,9.0],[9.0,9.23],[9.23,9.91],[9.91,10.6],[10.6,11.6],[11.6,12.1],[12.1,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.67],[13.7,14.0],[14.15,14.4],[14.4,14.6],[14.6,15.4],[15.4,15.7],[15.7,16.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.36],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3.2],[3.2,3.7],[3.7,4.9],[4.9,5.5],[5.56,6.01],[6.01,6.24],[6.4,7.31],[7.31,7.95],[7.95,8.57],[8.57,9.02],[9.02,10.0],[10.0,10.21],[10.21,10.86],[10.86,11.5],[11.5,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.4],[13.4,13.7],[13.7,14.9],[14.9,15.12],[15.12,15.7],[15.7,15.86],[15.86,16.5],[16.75,17.5],[17.5,17.8]]},"sync":[[["கண்","eye"],["தர","to give"]],[["வந்த","that came"]],[["காம","desire/passion"]],[["ஒள்","bright"],["எரி","fire"]],[["என்பு","bone"],["உற","intensely"]],[["நலியினும்","even if it afflicts"]],[["அவரொடு","with him"]],[["பேணி","cherishing"]],[["சென்று","having gone"],["நாம்","we"]],[["முயங்கற்கு","for embracing"]],[["முயங்கற்கு","for embracing"],["அருங்","difficult"],["காட்சியமே","are of rare sight"]],[["காட்சியமே","are of rare sight"]],[["வந்து","having come"],["அஞர்","grief"]],[["களைதலை","removing"]],[["அவர்","he"],["ஆற்றலரே","is not capable"]],[["ஆற்றலரே","is not capable"]],[["உய்த்தனர்","they led"]],[["விடாஅர்","they do not let go"]],[["பிரித்து","having separated"],["இடை","in between"]],[["களையார்","they do not remove"]],[["குப்பை","rubbish heap"],["கோழி","rooster"]],[["கோழி","rooster"],["தனி","solitary"]],[["தனி","solitary"],["போர்","fight"]],[["ப